      "content": "everything feels so heavy. like, i look at the end of the day and i just want it to be over. not just the workday, but the whole thing. i find myself staring out the window thinking about how quiet it would be if i just didn't have to wake up to this again. if the noise just stopped for good. it feels like the only way to actually get any peace is to just... stop existing in all this chaos. does that even make sense?",
